eValueCompletionProvider (around line 50-58) already handles values arrays natively, mapping each to a CompletionItem with CompletionItemKind.EnumMember. No new files, helpers, or providers needed. This pattern is widely used across tag...","timestamp":"2026-03-04T14:48:39.288Z"}]}
