yRequiredAttributeValue.rule.ts\\\",\\n      \\\"line\\\": 28,\\n      \\\"summary\\\": \\\"Inconsistent diagnostic message format between positional and named attributes\\\",\\n      \\\"detail\\\": \\\"Positional attributes produce 'Required src has an empty value...' while named attributes produce 'Required attribute \\\\\\\\'title\\\\\\\\' has an empty value...'. The positional message is missing the word 'attribute' and single quotes around the name.\\\",\\n      \\\"correction\\\": \\\"Change line 28 message to: `Required attribute '${attrDef.name}' has an empty value in tag '{% ${tagDefinition.tagName} %}'.`\\\"\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\\"code\\\": \\\"SUG-004\\\",\\n      \\\"severity\\\": \\\"suggestion\\\",\\n      \\\"file\\\": \\\"src/definitions/tags/block/card/diagnostics/imageAttrConflict.ts\\\",\\n      \\\"line\\\": 1,\\n      \\\"summary\\\": \\\"Orphaned file not deleted after migration to declarative mutuallyExclusiveWith\\\",\\n      \\\"detail\\\": \\\"The card tag was migrated from using validateCardIconImageConflict (custom rule) to declarative mutuallyExclusiveWith on icon/image attributes. The import was removed from card.types.ts, but this file was not deleted. It is dead code with no remaining imports.\\\",\\n      \\\"correction\\\": \\\"Delete src/definitions/tags/block/card/diagnostics/imageAttrConflict.ts and the parent diagnostics/ directory if empty.\\\"\\n    }\\n  ]\\n}\\n\"}"
